<title>USA: PSE to trade four new options from March 14.</title>
<headline>PSE to trade four new options from March 14.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange said Tuesday it would begin trading options on Air Express International Corp, Helen of Troy Corp, PDT Inc and Redwood Trust Inc on March 14.</p>
<p>The following table lists the companies and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and market makers.</p>
<p>Company	 Strikes	 Months	Limits   Market Makers</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Air Express   25, 30, 35     Apr, May,   4,500    Ron Goodman/</p>
<p>International Co		 Aug, Nov		 Mark Weinstock</p>
<p>Helen of Troy 22-1/2, 25,30  Apr, May,   4,500    Ron Goodman/</p>
<p>Corp				 Aug, Nov		 Mark Weinstock</p>
<p>PDT Inc	 30, 35, 40     Apr, May,   4,500    Guy Leung/</p>
<p>				     Jun, Sep		 Arvin Fong</p>
<p>Redwood	 50, 55, 60     Apr, May,   4,500    Steve Noonan/</p>
<p>Trust Inc			  Jul, Oct		 John Oppenheimer</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
